    "text": "By Skook News ,\n3 hours ago A Schuylkill County Coroner has been called to the scene of a crash on Burma Road in Ryan Township. Emergency personnel were dispatched to a reported head-on collision involving a passenger vehicle and a tractor-trailer near 1664 Burma Road. First responders arrived and confirmed the crash, prompting the closure of Burma Road in both directions as crews worked at the scene. Read full article\n1",
